## 🚀 How to Run Locally

### Prerequisites
Make sure you have [R](https://cloud.r-project.org/) and [RStudio](https://posit.co/download/rstudio-desktop/) installed.

### 1. Install Required Packages
Run the following script in your R console to install all required dependencies:

```r
install.packages(c(
  "shiny", "bslib", "leaflet", "leaflet.extras", "sf", "terra", 
  "zip", "dplyr", "units", "elevatr", "geodata", "openxlsx", 
  "smoothr", "plotly", "viridis", "whitebox"
))

# Install the underlying WhiteboxTools executable engine
whitebox::install_whitebox()
